c-15\">(m3\/m2\/min)<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-20\"><div class=\"magic-15\">21<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-21\"><div class=\"magic-15\">17<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-22\"><div class=\"magic-15\">14<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><div class=\"magic-19\"><div class=\"magic-15\">Tensile strength\/ warp<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-20\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&gt; 800<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-21\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&gt; 800<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-22\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&gt; 800<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><div class=\"magic-19\"><div class=\"magic-15\">Tensile strength\/ weft<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-20\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&gt; 1100<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-21\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&gt; 1200<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-22\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&gt; 1300<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><div class=\"magic-19\"><div class=\"magic-15\">Tensile elongation\/ warp<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-20\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&lt; 35<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-21\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&lt; 35<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-22\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&lt; 35<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><div class=\"magic-19\"><div class=\"magic-15\">Tensile elongation\/ weft<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-20\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&lt; 55<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-21\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&lt; 55<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-22\"><div class=\"magic-15\">&lt; 55<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><div class=\"magic-19\"><div class=\"magic-15\">Broke strength (Mpa\/min)<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-20\"><div class=\"magic-15\">2.55<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-21\"><div class=\"magic-15\">2.40<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-22\"><div class=\"magic-15\">2.35<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><div class=\"magic-19\"><div class=\"magic-15\">Working temperature (\u2103)<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-20\"><div class=\"magic-15\">\u2264 204<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-21\"><div class=\"magic-15\">\u2264 204<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-22\"><div class=\"magic-15\">\u2264 204<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><div class=\"magic-19\"><div class=\"magic-15\">Peak temperature (\u2103)<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-20\"><div class=\"magic-15\">250<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-21\"><div class=\"magic-15\">250<\/div><\/div><\/td><td><div class=\"magic-22\"><div class=\"magic-15\">250<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3><strong><b>Chemical Properties<\/b><\/strong><\/h3><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"121\">Acid Resistance<\/td><td width=\"124\">Alkali Resistance<\/td><td width=\"148\">Hydrolytic Resistance<\/td><td width=\"154\">Oxidation Resistance<\/td><td width=\"147\">Abrasion Resistance<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Good<\/td><td>Good<\/td><td>Good<\/td><td>Moderate<\/td><td>Excellent<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3>Technical Advantages in Manufacturing Nomex Filter Bags in Philite\u00ae<\/h3><ul><li>The base fabric of the aramid needle felt filter bag is made of high-quality, high-strength aramid long fibers to ensure that the filter bag has sufficient mechanical strength. It is pretreated and heat-set to form an aramid base fabric with stable size and performance.<\/li><li>The manufacturing process for Nomex filter bags involves a series of carefully controlled steps to ensure the final product meets the stringent requirements for industrial filtration applications. From the production of Nomex fibers to the cutting, sewing, and finishing of the filter bags, each step is designed to produce durable, high-performance filter bags capable of withstanding high temperatures and harsh chemical environments.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac9ff0b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ac9ff0b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d560297 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"d560297\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/aramid-needle-felt-\u8be6\u60c52.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2210\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/aramid-needle-felt-\u8be6\u60c52.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/aramid-needle-felt-\u8be6\u60c52-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/aramid-needle-felt-\u8be6\u60c52-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-93ae3af elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"93ae3af\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-01-\u8be6\u60c53.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-2209\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-01-\u8be6\u60c53.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-01-\u8be6\u60c53-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Custom-Nomex-Filter-Bags-01-\u8be6\u60c53-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b3a7a01 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b3a7a01\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Processing Detail of Nomex Filter Bags<\/h3><ul><li><strong>Seam Design<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Double-stitched seams using high-temperature resistant threads.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Top and Bottom Configurations<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Available in various designs, including snap band, ring top, and flange top for easy installation and secure fitting.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Support Rings<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Integrated support rings or other reinforcement structures to maintain bag shape and ensure optimal airflow.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Ground Wire<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Optional grounding wire to prevent static build-up in certain applications.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Finish Treatment<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Singeing, Calendering, Heat Setting, Anti-static, Water&amp;Oil Repellent, PTFE Membrane, PTFE Impregnation and so on special treatment can be chosen.<\/p><hr \/><h3><strong><b>Application of Nomex Filter Bags<\/b><\/strong><\/h3><ul><li><strong>Cement Kilns and Clinker Coolers<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Handling high-temperature and abrasive dust.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Steel Plants<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Used in electric arc furnaces and other high-temperature applications.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Power Plants<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Effective in fly ash collection and flue gas desulfurization units.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Asphalt Production<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Suitable for hot mix asphalt production dust collection.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Chemical Processing<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Employed in environments with corrosive chemicals and high temperatures.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elemento